{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12105","headline":"送李四擢第归觐省 · 钱起","name":"送李四擢第归觐省","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"当年贵得意，文字各争名。\n齐唱阳春曲，唯君金玉声。\n悬黎宝中出，高价世难掩。\n鸿羽不低飞，龙津徒自险。\n直矜鹦鹉赋，不贵芳桂枝。\n少俊蔡邕许，长鸣唐举知。\n梁城下熊轼，朱戟何暐耀。\n才子欲归宁，棠花已含笑。\n高门知庆大，子孝觉亲荣。\n独揽还珠美，宁唯问绢情。\n离筵不尽醉，掺袂一何早。\n马蹄西别轻，树色东看好。\n行尘忽不见，惆怅青门道。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12105.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12105","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}